# Guiding Center 4d Small Tokamak Deeply Passing with Gauss-Legendre VPRK Methods and Projections

The variational formulation of the same orbit as on the
[Gauss-Legendre Runge-Kutta page](guiding-center-4d-small-deeply-passing-firk-gauss.md), integrated with the
Gauss-Legendre variational partitioned Runge-Kutta methods and each of the projections onto the
constraint submanifold. The internal stage projection has no integrator in
GeometricIntegrators 0.16 and its runs fail here, as they do on every other VPRK page.

The small tokamak's particles are slow, so the time step is `\Delta t = 800` against the medium
tokamak's `2.5`; the toroidal momentum is shown alongside the energy. Both are set in
`src/guiding-center-4d.jl`.

```julia
run_list(iodeproblem(), "Guiding Center 4d Small Tokamak Deeply Passing", tableaus_vprk_gauss())
```
